  "description": "Writing horror was her passion. Now, it’s her nightmare. Bestselling author Ha Ji-an inherits a cursed keyboard that turns whatever she types into reality. But when she accidentally summons Joo Woo-geum—the ruthless serial killer from her own book—he doesn't cut her down. He confesses his love. Ji-an knows the terrifying truth: Woo-geum is a monster who kills the ones he loves. Desperate to change the story, she tries to rewrite his fate, but an unknown force keeps erasing her words. How do you escape a killer when you’re the one who gave him life?\nSource: MU",
